[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12840.71, "timestamp": "03:34:00", "text": "それは良くない言葉なので、乗り越えるべきです"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12844.635, "timestamp": "03:34:04", "author": "@christopherabrahams8923", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lXNBnVor2T5FVc9Go-w378cXn6JmX-YLkW1G6mVZyFzwgLjg01XTaBOrjvCuKmfuRq9g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12850.71, "timestamp": "03:34:10", "text": "はい、誰ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12852.99, "timestamp": "03:34:12", "text": "サム、君が最初に現れた時、彼はここにいなかったよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12856.11, "timestamp": "03:34:16", "text": "彼はもう戻ってきているはずだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12859.469, "timestamp": "03:34:19", "text": "私が盗んだら、彼が紹介を担当する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12863.269, "timestamp": "03:34:23", "text": "領主はたくさんのクエストを受け取った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12866.309, "timestamp": "03:34:26", "text": "えっと、彼のことについて何か教えていただけますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12869.55, "timestamp": "03:34:29", "text": "心は常にどこかにあるが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12871.469, "timestamp": "03:34:31", "text": "正しいことをする才能があると主張して"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12874.11, "timestamp": "03:34:34", "text": "タイミングが悪かったのは残念だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12875.51, "timestamp": "03:34:35", "text": "遺物が来るのが見えなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12877.59, "timestamp": "03:34:37", "text": "一緒にいると、彼はとても興奮するでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12879.349, "timestamp": "03:34:39", "text": "彼が到着すると興奮した表情を見せる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12880.67, "timestamp": "03:34:40", "text": "見て、彼は自分が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12881.95, "timestamp": "03:34:41", "text": "見逃した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12884.99, "timestamp": "03:34:44", "text": "星から外れた私とは一体何なのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12886.95, "timestamp": "03:34:46", "text": "私たちの上空の軌道上にあるステーションは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12889.51, "timestamp": "03:34:49", "text": "深宇宙スキャンをすべて実行します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12892.03, "timestamp": "03:34